00:00:14.849 --> 00:00:21.550
And this is something I'm not praising this
as morally a good thing, but Republicans seem

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:25.630
much more shrewd in this way than Democrats.

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:28.750
They're not jumping all over themselves to
condemn Matt Gates.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.070
They are sticking to a comment.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.279
There's a political article about this by
Gary.

00:00:32.279 --> 00:00:33.279
Find out.

