that include saying these allegations.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:42.970
Many of them were first reported by The New
York Times.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:44.890
That makes me skeptical.

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:47.230
That's perfect for the media.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:52.920
Skeptical right wing movement that Donald
Trump created with the meme of fake news,

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:56.430
say, listen, you know, we have to see what's
going on.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:01:00.050
But when the source is The New York Times,
I'm skeptical.

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:04.760
That's perfect cover for modern 20, 21 Republicans
to say that.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:08.890
Others are saying straight up, I believe it
is fake news.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:13.990
So down in Florida, there is a Gulf Breeze
activist named Larry Hatsu who straight up

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:16.039
