enough for many of them.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:30.170
Other Republicans aren't as dismissive, but
they are saying that the allegations are vague.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:31.729
It's unclear what's true.

00:01:31.729 --> 00:01:36.049
